==English==
[[File:Phase diagram of water simplified.svg|thumb|A '''phase diagram''' demonstrating the different phases in which [[water]] may exist depending on temperature and pressure.]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|physics|chemistry}} A [[graph]], with [[axes]] representing [[temperature]] and [[pressure]], showing the [[equilibrium]] [[condition]]s for a given [[substance]] to be a [[solid]], [[liquid]] or [[gas]].
# a similar diagram for a [[binary]] [[mixture]] of substances, with axes representing [[composition]] and temperature.

